In this lab you will work with variables in playbooks.

1. Create a playbook that prompts for the following variables:

	grid_endpoint
	grid_user
	grid_pass
  
   The playbook will display the results.

Hints:

*************************************************************     
				Start the playbook like this:
        ---
	- name: Get Variables 
          hosts: localhost
          gather_facts: false
          collections:
            - netapp.storagegrid
*************************************************************
				To get the variables use:
	vars_prompt:
	  - name: variablename1  
            prompt: value1
	    default: none
	    private: false
*************************************************************
				To display the variables use:
	tasks:
	  - name: Show result
            ansible.builtin.debug:
              msg: 
                firstvar: "{{ variablename1 }}" 
                secondvar: "{{ varialename2 }}"
